{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorconnect\/synthoutput"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MIDI output that plays on Apple’s multitimbral MIDI synth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(AUMIDISynth), loaded with a General MIDI sound bank, so that music can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be heard with no other software."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Outputs","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/MIDIOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDIDestinationOutput","doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/CoreMIDISourceOutput"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Outputs"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SynthOutput","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/UsingIvorConnect"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each channel keeps its own program. Only the 128 programs of bank 0 are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loaded at first; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorConnect\/documentation\/IvorConnect\/SynthOutput\/preload(_:)","isActive":true},{"type"